  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Deoxyribo nucleic acid or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>DNA</mi></math> contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>-deoxy-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>-ribose sugar unit, whereas ribo nucleic acid or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>RNA</mi></math> contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>-ribose sugar unit.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0078_4ff865ad0948.png\" style=\"width: 216px; height: 120px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> deoxyribose in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>DNA</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0078_79018c768a4e.png\" style=\"width: 167px; height: 120px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>-ribose in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>RNA</mi></math></p>"
